_:18 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#cardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:20 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#minQualifiedCardinality> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
_:25 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#qualifiedCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger> .
